Market Challenges and Considerations
Despite rapid adoption, several factors currently restrain market expansion:
1.	Technical Limitations - Performance varies significantly across device types and lighting conditions
2.	Implementation Costs - Enterprise solutions require substantial investment ($100,000+)
3.	Privacy Concerns - 38% of consumers express reservations about facial data collection
4.	Color Accuracy - Remains challenging for certain product types and skin tones
Industry leaders are actively addressing these challenges through improved algorithms, more efficient deployment models, and enhanced transparency about data usage.
